<newsitem itemid="189512" id="root" date="1996-11-14" xml:lang="en">
<title>FRANCE: AGF nine month sales down 12.1 pct.</title>
<headline>AGF nine month sales down 12.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					51,387    vs   58,441</p>
<p>Of which</p>
<p>     -- life assurance in France	    16,609    vs   19,247</p>
<p>     -- non-life in France		    14,806    vs   13,648</p>
<p>     -- insurance outside France	    14,717    vs   19,702</p>
<p>     -- Credit insurance			 2,707    vs    2,139</p>
<p>     -- reinsurance				2,548    vs    3,705</p>
<p>NOTE - Groupe AGF said in a statement that on a constant structure basis total sales would have been up by 5.5 percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
